Question. 12 Write a query to get the total salary, maximum, minimum, average salary of employees (job ID wise), for department ID 90 only.

SELECT 
    job_id, 
    SUM(salary) AS total_salary, 
    MAX(salary) AS maximum_salary, 
    MIN(salary) AS minimum_salary, 
    AVG(salary) AS average_salary 
FROM employees 
WHERE department_id = 90 
GROUP BY job_id;
